OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fthrough the night allowing
OL,7,Ftemperatures to drop away quickly
OL,8,Fafter dark. Mist and fog likely
OL,9,Fforming across the region by morning
OL,10,Funder light winds, perhaps leading to
OL,11,Ftravel delays on Friday morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FFog and low cloud slow to
OL,14,Fclear but once it does, another day of
OL,15,Flong sunny spells and light winds
OL,16,Ffollows. Widespread fog returns
OL,17,Fovernight into the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
