OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells continue on Saturday, then
OL,7,Ffurther fog developing overnight.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier on Sunday with some
OL,9,Flight, patchy rain before long spells
OL,10,Fof sunshine return on Monday. Light
OL,11,Fwinds throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
